`),x2={"session-live":{about:"Every agent here at once, live: what it types, each tool call and its result, what it hands back, what it asks you.",help:$l("Lines land in the order they happen; each one is tagged with its agent: its colour, its name and its state (cyan works, amber waits, green done, red failed).","A tool call is one row: the tool, what it runs on, the time ticking while it runs, then the first line of its result.","Follow keeps the newest line in view; scroll up and it pauses, ↓ N new brings you back.","Click a tag: only that agent, with Steer at the bottom; the tag again (or Esc) shows everyone. Hover a line: its node lights on the map.","An ask lands as an amber card with its A / R / S / O answers; the newest 500 lines stay here, the full log is in Activity.")},"session-map":{about:"Your sessions on this machine, each one's agents as a tree: who spawned whom, the model, the cost, the tool running now.",help:$l("Each agent sits under the one that spawned it; a node shows its model, what it costs and, while a tool runs, its name and time (Bash 12s).","A cyan pulse works, amber waits on you, green just finished (it fades), red failed (it stays); the edge to it glows the same.","Click an agent to select it (its session becomes the chosen one); double-click opens Agent expanded; the ... menu has Steer, Pause, Stop, Take over, Hand to, Record.","J / K hop between this harness's live agents; Fleet (Alt+4) still shows every harness.")},"session-agent":{about:"The selected agent: what it thinks, what it runs, what it hands back; steer it.",help:$l("A strip until you open it (double-click an agent on the map opens it too).","Thinking is its text as it types it, Working one row per tool call, Output its hand-back.","Steer: a nudge it reads before its next step, or redirect to give it a new task. Pause holds it at its next step; Stop asks first (K here does the same).","F follows, Space pins a mini stream that stays on screen in every section.")},"session-activity":{about:"What the chosen session does: a timeline lane per live agent over its full live log.",help:$l("Each lane shows an agent's states over 5, 15 or 60 minutes; the ticks are its tool calls.","The session pick switches between the chosen session and every session on this harness.","Filter by agent or kind; Follow keeps the newest line in view; click a line to select that agent.")},"session-attention":{about:"What waits on you in this harness's sessions, oldest first, one key each.",help:$l("Cards (permission, question, plan, approval), gates, paused agents and spend caps of this harness; each also lands in Live as it arrives.","A accepts or allows, R denies or redoes with your text, S stops, O opens the panel it belongs to.","J / K (or the arrows) move between rows while this panel has the focus.")},"session-cost":{about:"What the chosen session has cost: the spend and how it rose, the context filling, cost per turn, each agent's share.",help:$l("The spend ticks up as the session's model answers; the sparkline beside it is the spend since this page opened.","The context bar is how full the model's context is: amber past 80 %, red past 95 %.","Per turn is the spend over the turns; the stacked bar is each agent's share, its tokens in and out beside it.","Choose another session on the map (or in Activity's session pick) and Cost follows it.")}},Bf=(...e)=>e.join(`
